      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "b. HUDC shall coordinate the strategic planning process mandated by the Act, in order to ensure that such process is open to participation by the entire Harlem community and reflects the views of Harlem residents, representatives of the Harlem business community, and organizations concerned with the economic development and social service needs of the area. The strategic planning process coordinated by HUDC shall include the conduct of public hearings, the solicitation of written proposals, and other outreach effects.",
